cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this living review, please cite it as below."
title: "A Living Systematic Review of Robotic Active Matter"
abstract: >-
  A PRISMA 2020 living systematic review of robotic realizations and
  theoretical models of active matter. The repository hosts the pipeline
  that discovers, deduplicates, screens, and extracts data from the
  literature; a companion Jekyll website that renders the current corpus,
  PRISMA flow, and change log; and the REVTeX source for a manuscript
  targeted at Reviews of Modern Physics.
type: dataset
authors:
